title: Genesis 25 – Esau and Jacob
description: A verse-by-verse study of Genesis 25: Abraham gives all that he had unto Isaac and is gathered to his people, Abraham's seed which is Christ, the generations of Ishmael, Rebekah's twins, the elder shall serve the younger, Esau sells his birthright, and spiritual Edom.
output: lessons/genesis/genesis-25-esau-and-jacob.html
context: Genesis 25

# Genesis series pattern (Genesis 1-5). Slide text is the author's own sentences from the Genesis 25 study (posts
